Well, look: how do you rob shops in real life? Everybody has his own 
methods... Small thefts are probably most popular, but in a small
shop, where you are the only customer, they can be difficult. Killing
the shopkeeper is a bit drastic - people usually prefer just threatening
him. Braking through walls or floors is sometimes practiced - but
usually only when the shopkeeper is not inside. And the broken 
walls/windows/floors generally repair themselves quite fast (shortly after
the Kops leave). So here nethack is OK. 

And, despite the variety of methods (there exist also other, more exotic
ideas), most people around here seem to simply pay for the things they 
take from shops...

So, how do YOU rob shops?

